WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:09.113
The warm, blue light filled Cora's arms.

2
00:00:09.114 --> 00:00:15.309
"Is this magic?" Cora thought.

3
00:00:15.310 --> 00:00:21.444
She swam closer to the shell.

4
00:00:21.445 --> 00:00:30.036
"Be careful, Cora!" Mo yelled.

5
00:00:30.037 --> 00:00:32.973
Whoosh! Cora shot her ink again.

6
00:00:32.974 --> 00:00:35.546
The ink hit the shell.

7
00:00:35.547 --> 00:00:38.301
"Whoa!" Mo cried.

8
00:00:38.302 --> 00:00:41.240
"Why is your ink blue now?"

9
00:00:41.241 --> 00:00:45.789
"I don't know," Cora said.

10
00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:49.172
"But look! The shell is opening!"

11
00:00:49.173 --> 00:00:54.053
Mo and Cora looked at the shell.

12
00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:56.014
In the top was a picture.

13
00:00:56.015 --> 00:01:00.319
It showed a shrimp.

14
00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:04.911
In the bottom lay a red arrow.

15
00:01:04.912 --> 00:01:10.599
"The shell looks like a compass," Cora said.

16
00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:15.201
The arrow started to spin fast.

17
00:01:15.202 --> 00:01:22.909
Then it flew up out of the shell.

18
00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.762
"Scary!" Mo said.

19
00:01:25.763 --> 00:01:29.793
"Cool!" Cora said.

20
00:01:29.794 --> 00:01:33.558
Suddenly the arrow stopped.

21
00:01:33.559 --> 00:01:35.627
It pointed out of the cave.

22
00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:38.172
Then it flew outside.

23
00:01:38.173 --> 00:01:41.888
"Let's follow the arrow, Mo!" Cora cried.

24
00:01:41.889 --> 00:01:46.297
"Maybe it will take us to Sasha!"

25
00:01:46.298 --> 00:01:52.322
Mo groaned. "This is crazy."

26
00:01:52.323 --> 00:02:01.727
But he swam after Cora.

27
00:02:01.728 --> 00:02:07.560
They swam through the storm's big mess.

28
00:02:07.561 --> 00:02:13.522
They followed the arrow to Seaweed Forest.

29
00:02:13.523 --> 00:02:24.523
Suddenly Mo gulped. "Uh-oh! Eels!"

